doctype html
html(lang="id")
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
        title Pendaftaran Vendor Diterima - Mitra10
    body(style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f2f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a2e;")
        table(role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color:#f0f2f5;")
            tr
                td(style="padding:40px 10px;")
                    table(role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="600" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e9ecef;")
                        tr
                            td(style="background-color:#1E2A78;padding:32px 35px;text-align:center;")
                                h1(style="color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.3px;") Instalasi &amp; Service Mitra 10
                        tr
                            td(style="padding:32px 35px;")
                                h2(style="font-size:20px;color:#1a1a2e;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-weight:700;") Pendaftaran #{data.company_name} sudah masuk.
                                p(style="font-size:14px;color:#495057;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px 0;")
                                    | Tim Mitra10 akan tinjau data yang Anda kirimkan. Estimasi waktu tinjauan 1-3 hari kerja. Kami hubungi lewat email atau telepon PIC kalau ada yang perlu dilengkapi.
                                table(role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color:#f8f9fa;border-left:4px solid #1E2A78;border-radius:4px;margin:0 0 24px 0;")
                                    tr
                                        td(style="padding:18px 22px;")
                                            p(style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#1E2A78;margin:0 0 12px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;") Data Terdaftar
                                            p(style="font-size:13px;color:#495057;margin:0 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;")
                                                span(style="color:#6c757d;display:inline-block;width:130px;") Email perusahaan
                                                span(style="color:#1a1a2e;font-weight:600;") #{data.email_address}
                                            p(style="font-size:13px;color:#495057;margin:0 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;")
                                                span(style="color:#6c757d;display:inline-block;width:130px;") Email PIC
                                                span(style="color:#1a1a2e;font-weight:600;") #{data.pic_email}
                                            p(style="font-size:13px;color:#495057;margin:0;line-height:1.6;")
                                                span(style="color:#6c757d;display:inline-block;width:130px;") Telepon PIC
                                                span(style="color:#1a1a2e;font-weight:600;") #{data.pic_phone}
                                p(style="font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;line-height:1.6;margin:0;padding:16px 18px;background-color:#fff8e1;border-radius:4px;border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;")
                                    strong(style="color:#92400e;") Langkah selanjutnya:&nbsp;
                                    span Email kedua berisi akun untuk memantau status pendaftaran akan dikirim beberapa saat lagi. Cek inbox Anda.
                        tr
                            td(style="background-color:#f8f9fa;padding:22px 35px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;")
                                p(style="font-size:12px;color:#6c757d;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 4px 0;")
                                    | Mitra10 Instalasi &amp; Service
                                    br
                                    a(href=data.website_url style="color:#1E2A78;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;") instalasi.mitra10.com
                                p(style="font-size:11px;color:#adb5bd;margin:0;") Email otomatis. Jangan balas.
